            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>I hereby certify that after having been advertised for sale pursuant to Sec. 260 of RA 7160 otherwise known as the Local Government Code (LGC) of 1991, and subject to the conditions set forth therein, the delinquent real property (land/building/machinery/ improvement) described hereunder was sold at the public auction:</Value>
